Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:28.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄罗斯 莫斯科）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,隧道追击的嫌疑犯正从 基辅斯基火车站向东逃离
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意负责这个计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you commit to this program?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意负责这个计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you commit to this program?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意负责这个计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you commit to this program?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有武器
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把对讲机给我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你无仇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:04:01.32,Title,0,0,0,0,,《谍影重重3》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:06.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六周后）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:12.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中央情报局 维吉尼亚州 兰利）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能逃出如来佛的手掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no place it won't catch up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的故事都是这结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how every story ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的本性 杰森 是个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what you are, Jason, a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远也无法改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续啊！快啊！动手 动手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Go on. Go on! Do it! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会让我这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你活着的唯一理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only reason you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「她」是指谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is "she"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽·克鲁兹 他的女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie Kreutz, his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在印度被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was killed in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是中情局行动主管 华德·艾伯特下的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director of Operations Ward Abbott arranged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 我们的一位无耻主管杀了他女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have a dirty section chief who kills Bourne's girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩回来报仇 录下了艾伯特供词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne comes back for revenge, tapes Abbott's confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后艾伯特自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Abbott commits suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在他来找我们算帐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Bourne's gunning for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:04:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't make this stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近发现伯恩的踪影是在莫斯科 六个星期前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne's last confirmed location was Moscow, six weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在逃亡中 很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the run. He's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.34,0:05:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 恕我直言 我认为可能还有其他原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sir, with respect, I think something else could be going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？他为什么要逃亡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's he after?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩去莫斯科是为了 找他第一个杀害目标的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reason Bourne went to Moscow was to see the daughter of his first target.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是什么 帕梅？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point, Pam?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能他在回忆他的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he was retracing his steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在寻找某样东西 他回忆里的某样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's looking for something. Something in his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他还没找到 我们需要知道他在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he hasn't found it yet and we need to know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他对我们没有威胁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me he's not a threat to this agency?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想如果他真的想害我们 大可以把录音带寄到CNN去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think if he wanted to hurt us, he could have sent the tape to CNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he still will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的首要原则就是 抱着最大的希望做最坏的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}My number one rule is hope for the best, plan for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言 伯恩始终是个很大的威胁 除非你能证明我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I'm concerned, Bourne is still a serious threat until proven otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续寻找他的踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:57.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（意大利 都灵）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是三年前的照片 那时有一半的国际刑警都在追捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's three years ago. They had half of Interpol after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他曾出现在那不勒斯 柏林 莫斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turned up in Naples, Berlin, Moscow…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disappeared again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,与他一起逃亡的女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl that he was on the run with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽·克鲁兹 尸体在另一半地球的河里被找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie Kreutz. She was found dead in a river halfway round the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,头部中枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd been shot in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都意味着什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What connects the dots?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,把录音机关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off the tape recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:19.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（法国 巴黎）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不先坐下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.99,0:08:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道会是这个结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew this could end this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来就没有过特例\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always gonna end this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how did she die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,被枪杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我俩在印度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were together in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人的目标是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都起源于某人 我要把他找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone started all of this and I'm gonna find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:49.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（希思路国际机场 英国 伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He knows the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩只不过是冰山一角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne's just the tip of the iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:10:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说过「黑荆棘」计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard of an Operation Blackbriar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好整理一下并写成报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get my head around this and type it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:13.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中情局分局 英国 伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃施朗电子监测网发现关键词「黑荆棘」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanning. GoSat 21. I have a hit on ECHELON. Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍 是「黑荆棘」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号似乎来自欧洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it's coming from a European signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家安全局 请确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}NSA, please confirm your receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到频率和坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring up the frequency and the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,截获我们首要的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…intercept of our principal…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官！- 什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir! - What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们截获到了在伦敦的一通电话 内容带有关键词「黑荆棘」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We intercepted a call in London. Keyword, "Blackbriar."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 马上发给纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, send it to New York right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:54.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中情局掩护机构 反恐局 纽约）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟踪到电话来源了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,登记者是一位叫 赛门·罗斯的伦敦记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Registered to a London reporter named Simon Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:05.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,为《卫报》工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works at the Guardian newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你正在跟踪他吗？- 是的 长官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're tracking him? - Sir. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个调查小组正在跟踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a survey team covering him at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外还派了一组人潜入他的公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a sneak and peek's on their way to his apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟谁联系过？他怎么会知道「黑荆棘」计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who talked to him? How did he find out about Blackbriar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我们已经调查过他的背景\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. We pulled his background.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且反复确认了所有的疑点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ran a cross-check on any known anomalies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但什么也没有发现 不过我认为只要跟踪罗斯 就能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've come up with nothing. But I think if we follow Ross, we're gonna be able…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 罗斯不重要 我们要的是消息来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, Ross is easy. We want the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说过「黑荆棘」计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard of an Operation Blackbriar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有细节吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have details?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好整理一下并写成报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get my head around this and type it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这些？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that all? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备标准行动 为以防万一 让杀手待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want rendition protocols and put the asset on standby, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听着 这是4级紧急事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}People, listen up! This is a full priority situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 把罗斯的档案投到1号屏上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, give me Ross' profile on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目标是一位英国记者 赛门·罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our target is a British national, Simon Ross. A reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要监视他所有的电话记录 黑莓短讯 公寓 车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want all his phones, his BlackBerry, his apartment, his car,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,银行账户 信用卡账户 旅行记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}bank accounts, credit cards, travel patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在他下一步行动之前 知道他的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what he's gonna think before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道他的一切秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every dirty little secret he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是 我要知道他线人的名字 以及实时位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}And most of all, we want the name and real-time location of his source.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是国家安全局4级紧急事件 有什么疑问吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is NSA priority level four. Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:44.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（赛门·罗斯 国际安全事务通讯员）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:49.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（谁是杰森·伯恩？特别报导之三）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:54.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德国BND正与南印度警方联手调查 一位德国女性的死亡原因）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:57.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（该名女性疑为伯恩同伙 在其座驾堕桥之后淹死在河里）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意负责这个计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you commit to this program?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 威尔逊先生 目标正进入办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. Mr. Wills, the subject is entering his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我派几个眼线到街上监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some eyeballs on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的现场视频呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my picture, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快连上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming online.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,连上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Online now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 电话线那里怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, how you doing with the phone line?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已能监听他的办公室电话 现在正在处理手机线路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we have an office line. We're working on his cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还得花多久 - 一个小时 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long? - An hour, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,太慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道他是不是受人指使？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we know he's not spinning for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更多黑幕 他很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was more. He was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怕什么？- 「黑荆棘」计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scared about what? - Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.97,0:14:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打扰一下 有你的电话 - 是谁打来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. Call for you. - Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不肯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't give his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在我的线上 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's on my line. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门·罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号摄像头 大屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camera three, screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么听不到对话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't we hearing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 这是座机 为什么我们监听不到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a hard line, Jimmy. Why don't we have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经监听了他的线路 但他不在那条线上 他在用别人的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have his line, sir, but he's not on it. He's using a different phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过你的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been reading your stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this? - This is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑铁卢车站 南站口 三十分钟后 独自过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waterloo Station. South entrance. Thirty minutes. Come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,特德 尽快搞定声音信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me audio as soon as you can, Ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,街道A组、B组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Street teams Alpha, Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计们 行动 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, let's work it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始行动了 派一组眼线到街上监视 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, he is on the move. Give me eyeballs on the street. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:24.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（滑铁卢车站）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标正离开大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject exiting the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人注意 找出他的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everyone, let's find out where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.07,0:15:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,外勤1号 我需要声音信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mobile One, I need audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动声音信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Audio engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,外勤1号跟上他 外勤1号跟上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mobile One should have him. Mobile One should have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,外勤1号跟踪他 听到内容后通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Mobile One on it. Let me know when you hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑铁卢车站 南站口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Waterloo Station, south entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 威尔逊先生 - 他要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Wills. - Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的地是滑铁卢车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destination is Waterloo Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 滑铁卢车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Waterloo Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上派眼线前往滑铁卢车站 派出所有人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me eyes at Waterloo. Put everyone in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 命令杀手行动 - 调动外勤3号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's activate the asset. - Mobilize Tracker Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到桥上了吗？- 还没有 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we at the bridge yet? - Not yet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 外勤3号 叫他们与目标保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mobile Three, tell them to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持监视距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please maintain visual contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一台预付费手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepaid phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,外勤1号 请给出目标现在的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mobile One, give me the subject's current location.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.11,0:17:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 目标正在前往 滑铁卢车站的南站口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the subject is arriving at the south entrance of Waterloo Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.97,0:17:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我传到5号和7号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that on five and seven as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 我需要知道电话的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, I need that phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细听着我要说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to listen very carefully to what I'm about to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:17:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你左手边10点钟位置 街道对面 停着一辆银色克莱斯勒旅行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten o'clock, to your left, across the street, there's a silver Chrysler Voyager.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是一队监视小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a surveillance team inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,正前方街道对面 12点位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Directly across the street, twelve noon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个男人在二楼立柱旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a man on the second story, static post.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你左边50米距离外有个公交车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there's a bus stop 50 meters to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.19,0:18:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就朝那个方向走去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to walk towards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 我需要电话的通话内容！昨天就交代了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, I need that phone! I need it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在行动 他在行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the move. He's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是他的电话 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not his phone, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是他的电话 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not his phone, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫不是他的电话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean that's not his phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那部电话是从哪来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did he get another phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 不 你只要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, you just have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕队B组 准备行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab Team B, stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕队B组 准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab Team B. We're in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有一个穿蓝色有帽T恤的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there's a man in a blue hooded sweatshirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.31,0:18:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在打电话 走到他的身边 然后停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's talking on a phone. Walk directly to him and stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 我们需要通话内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, we need the call. I need that cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他离开视线范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let him get out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 转过身来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个穿蓝色有帽T恤的家伙是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, who's the guy in the blue hood?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的联系人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that his contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一辆公交车正在靠站 大概10秒钟后会到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there's a bus coming. It'll be there in ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一停下来 你就开始往左走\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it stops, I want you to walk directly to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:19:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有个天桥 到楼上的卖报小亭那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an overpass. Go up the stairs. Stop at the newsstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在那里得到进一步指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着那辆公交 盯着那辆公交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch that bus. Watch that bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? All right, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁能告诉我状况 我们失去了一切视频监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody tell me. We lost the feed. Grab Team B.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕队B组 抓住他的联系人 跟紧罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intercept the contact and stay with Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.85,0:19:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是外勤1号 目标已开始移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mobile One. Target's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.42,0:19:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始移动了 别跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, he's on the move. Do not lose Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.49,0:19:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝帽子！趴下！马上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue hood! Down! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.93,0:19:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们失去了与外勤1号的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we've lost all communication with Mobile One.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边！往西 发现目标后通知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the right! Heading west. Let us know when you get a visual!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的所在位置是哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the last known position, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在通往中央广场的人行道上 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the walkway, heading towards the concourse, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:20:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是监控队的噩梦 伦敦最忙碌的车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a surveillance nightmare. It's the busiest terminal in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,接入所有闭路监视系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me all of CCTV's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在处理中 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 杀手已到现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, asset's on scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的消息线人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's your source?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字？你的线人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name? What's your source's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 到底发生什么事了？为什么有一群人在追捕我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, what's going on? Why are these people after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你知道得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你与「踩石」行动的内部人士沟通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talked to someone inside Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个从一开始就参与在其中的人 那个人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who was there at the beginning. Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不能透露\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道你惹了多大的祸 如果有必要 那些人是会杀人灭口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what you're into here. These people will kill you, if they have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为「黑荆棘」计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it Blackbriar? Is that what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么「黑荆棘」计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Blackbriar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,「踩石」计划的升级版 我的联系人说一切都是从你开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treadstone upgrade. My source told me it all started with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你是这个肮脏秘密的第一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that you were square one, the dirty little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.05,0:21:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he knows who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.86,0:21:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we have to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持电话联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就要连上了 - 找到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coming online. - You got visual?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is he, people?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.51,0:21:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的指示 现在走向你的右方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do exactly as I say. I need you to move up to your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,右手边第一个电扶梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}First escalator on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.93,0:21:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上系鞋带 系鞋带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie your shoe. Tie your shoe right now. Tie your shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:22:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会从你身边走过 我要你靠着左手边的墙走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna walk by you. I want you to move along the far wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.31,0:22:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your left in four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.42,0:22:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.99,0:22:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.79,0:22:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们决不能让那家伙失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot afford to lose this guy, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.03,0:22:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你现在的方向很好 保持那个方向前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that line you're on is good. Stay on that line. Stay on that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去接孩子了 你买完东西了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta go and pick up the kids. Can you go and get the shopping done?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.94,0:22:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 那个大块头 我想他是他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the bin man, I think he's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.14,0:22:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个收垃圾的？不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The garbage man? Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他在拿东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus. Jesus! He's reaching for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.81,0:22:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝 他有枪 他有枪 - 保持那个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God, he's got a gun. - Stay on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.98,0:22:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有枪 他有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a gun. He's got a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持那个方向 不要往别处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on the line you're on. Do not deviate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.99,0:22:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他了！他在那儿 他在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there he is! Here he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕队A组 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab Team A. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在跟某人通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still talking to somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.76,0:22:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在接受指令 吉米 给我监听通话内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting instructions. Jimmy, get me the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外勤2号 我要… - 快 赶快合围\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mobile Two, I want… - Come on, lock the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.93,0:22:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快合围 跟进 逮捕队C组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the box. Move in, Grab Team C.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.36,0:22:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 罗斯 我们得走快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Ross. We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,混入人群 马上混入人群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, move through this crowd. Move through this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.03,0:22:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上隐蔽 混入人群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get undercover right now. Move through this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,到店里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在跟踪你 到店里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone on your tail. Get in the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.25,0:23:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要从东边的门出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna proceed out the east exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.81,0:23:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你进门的右手边\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's to your right as you come into the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入你前方的酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head into the liquor store in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.03,0:23:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后从后门离开 把门锁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go into the back and lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,外勤4号失去联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mobile Four is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙有帮手 告诉我杀手什么时候能够行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's got help. Tell me when the asset's in the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要里面的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a feed in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.68,0:23:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要逮捕队C组到里面去 告诉我那里发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Grab Team C in there. Tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.12,0:23:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,4号队移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team Four is mobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.83,0:24:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.50,0:24:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.57,0:24:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在逐一除掉我们的人 你认为他是线人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's picking us apart. Do you think he's the source?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.34,0:24:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,守住所有出口 让杀手行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block all the exits. Give the asset a green light.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.88,0:24:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们两个都除掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them both out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.26,0:25:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在那别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.83,0:25:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得想办法突围出去 你得依我的指示行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get us out of here. You gotta do exactly what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.14,0:25:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这可不是什么报纸里瞎编的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me! This isn't some story in a newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.91,0:25:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是真的 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real. You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.48,0:25:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有特工撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call all agents back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.52,0:25:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉杀手伯恩的位置：商店后边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Bourne's location at the back of the store to the asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.09,0:25:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.61,0:25:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,支开所有监控摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.25,0:26:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯恩 - 等一下 好像有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bourne. - Wait. Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.99,0:26:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从这里可以看到入口 如果我现在行动 应该能安全逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see the entrance from here. If I go now, I can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.60,0:26:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.80,0:26:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在那里别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.73,0:26:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we should wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.17,0:26:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在朝这个方向走来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.21,0:26:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拼一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.34,0:26:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.28,0:28:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里出了些状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.98,0:28:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.65,0:28:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷莫局长要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director Kramer would like to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.45,0:28:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要得到许可证…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get those warrants…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.66,0:28:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是紧急事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.66,0:28:40.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（什么是「黑荆棘」计划？）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.16,0:28:48.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杰森·伯恩）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.22,0:29:15.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西班牙 马德里）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.52,0:29:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方已确认 被害者年龄35岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the police will tell me is that they believe the victim is 35-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.39,0:29:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫赛门·罗斯 是伦敦的一名著名记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon Ross, a well-known journalist based here in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.86,0:29:26.62,Title,0,0,0,0,,供职于《卫报》\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the Guardian newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.69,0:29:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现场证据表明他是被枪杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears that he was gunned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.36,0:29:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点为滑铁卢车站广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}right in the middle of the Waterloo Station concourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间约为午后3时45分\N{\fnArial\fs30}around 3:45 this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有上百位乘客目睹了事件的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}in full view of hundreds of commuters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年 他揭露了许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the years, he's uncovered a lot of.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.21,0:29:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不为人知的恐怖事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}unsavory stories about terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.17,0:29:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此 得罪了某些西方国家政府…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that have upset certain Western governments and…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你好 - 在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, how are you? - Right over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.74,0:30:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.67,0:30:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 先生 您想点些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, sir. Can I take your order? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.17,0:30:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来个煎蛋 奶酪加胡椒粉 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the Heart-Healthy omelet with goat cheese and peppers, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.11,0:30:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您想要些什么 女士？- 咖啡 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything for you, ma'am? - Just coffee, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要咖啡？我买单哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure? I'm buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.31,0:30:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,局长打来电话 他建议让你加入行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when the Director called and it was suggested that we bring you on…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.35,0:30:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,建议？真的只是建议而已吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suggested? You sure it was just a suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.47,0:30:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's funny how different things look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.57,0:30:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一件事因所处位置不同 表述的不同 效果也不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}depending on where you sit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.74,0:30:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 这对你是个帮助 帕梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look at this as a favor for you, Pam,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.07,0:30:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你个机会完成你未完成的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}giving you an opportunity to complete some unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.41,0:30:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.94,0:30:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩 他在这里 他是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne. He's here. He's a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.85,0:30:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们 要的是同样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we both want the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.92,0:31:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们获得的手段相去甚远\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we both go about it in two very different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.55,0:31:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的就让它过去吧 帕梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The past is past, Pam. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.22,0:31:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯德哥尔摩的事 我们太大意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were careless in Stockholm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.59,0:31:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么滑铁卢站这次 也是大意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what was Waterloo? Just careless again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.33,0:31:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人泄密 这是非常严重的国家安全问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a leak. A serious national security situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.76,0:31:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩在我们的监视下现身 我们几乎没有时间考虑如何应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne showed up on our surveillance and we had very little time to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.70,0:31:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个记者被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a reporter got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.07,0:31:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩知道我们会行动 关键是 他来这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne saw us coming. The question is what was he doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.07,0:31:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 关键是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the real question is how you managed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.57,0:31:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可以让杀手在公共车站射击？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get into a firefight at a public train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.14,0:31:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我都知道 危急状态下 不得不作出欠周全的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know as well as I do decisions made in real time are never perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.31,0:31:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不着事后诸葛亮 你这是站着说话不腰疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't second-guess an operation from an armchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.52,0:31:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,办公室见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.02,0:31:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享用你的蛋白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your egg whites.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.94,0:32:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.48,0:32:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是帕梅拉·兰蒂 和她的助手汤姆·克罗宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Pamela Landy and her associate, Tom Cronin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.72,0:32:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她将领导这次的搜寻行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna be quarterbacking the search effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.12,0:32:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,报上你们的名字和职务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say your names. State your specs, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.69,0:32:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿再报名字吧 伯恩的上一个现身地点是哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's do names later, okay? What's Bourne's last fixed position?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.82,0:32:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦 12：00\N{\fnArial\fs30}London, 1200 Zulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.36,0:32:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,状态？有携带武器吗？受伤否？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Status. What is he? Armed? Wounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.46,0:32:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着 机动 未知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive, mobile and unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.26,0:32:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 申请跨国追踪了吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we have an ECHELON package? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.83,0:32:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么还未启动？- 我们在等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why isn't it on? - We were waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.97,0:32:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待？还等什么？什么… 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting? For what? What… Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.30,0:32:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道自己面对的是什么人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}people, do you have any idea who you're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.41,0:32:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.64,0:32:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你们追踪过的最难对付的人 而你们已经落后了9小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nine hours behind the toughest target you have ever tracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.21,0:32:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要求每个人用上所有注意力 投入百分百精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I want everyone to sit down, strap in and turn on all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.88,0:32:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在立即行动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would mean now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.65,0:32:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.15,0:32:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一支队伍 负责筹划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a team deployment plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.65,0:32:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,将罗斯的所有资料放到一号屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everything you got on Ross on screen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.21,0:33:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 找到了点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I think we have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.85,0:33:11.82,Title,0,0,0,0,,我们截获了罗斯在《卫报》的电邮帐号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just hacked Ross' e-mail account at the Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.88,0:33:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现昨天前往意大利都灵的来回机票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found a round-trip ticket to Turin, Italy, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.55,0:33:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,08：00到达 12：00起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}0800 arrival, 1205 departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.26,0:33:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本可以确定 伯恩不是他的线人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can be pretty certain that Bourne's not your source, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.99,0:33:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯刚下都灵飞回伦敦的飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ross's call to his editor where he said he'd just met the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.60,0:33:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就打电话给他的编辑 说他刚见过他的线人\N{\fnArial\fs30}took place just after his Turin flight landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.70,0:33:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说明他在都灵跟线人会了面 - 那么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He met his source in Turin. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.94,0:33:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？难道伯恩和罗斯先在都灵共进早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? So, what? Bourne met Ross in Turin for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.54,0:33:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又在同一天约在滑铁卢车站会面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then at noon the same day Bourne calls Ross to demand a meet at Waterloo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.91,0:33:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他们还乘坐同一班飞机呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they were even on the same flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.41,0:33:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看都有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.81,0:33:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,核对所有CIA内部登记的手机使用情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross-check the secure cell phone usage of everyone with SCI clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.15,0:33:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,追查罗斯在都灵的时间内 所有打入和打出的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}against all calls going in and out of Turin, Italy, the morning Ross was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.35,0:33:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找的人是CIA特工 他掌握了高度机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy you're after is a CIA operative with clearance above top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.96,0:33:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他与罗斯的谈话是叛国行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's committing treason by talking to Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.76,0:33:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他既然知道我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think while doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.86,0:33:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以追踪到他的手机 还会用手机联络吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna use a cell phone that he knows we can track?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.03,0:33:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,未能查到任何记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero results on the cross-check.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.80,0:33:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你有什么高见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you got any better ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.60,0:34:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,查询罗斯在都灵整个期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, look at all the people whose cell phones were switched off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.83,0:34:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有关闭手机的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the entire period Ross was in Turin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.57,0:34:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果大家都像我一样经常打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if your people are on their phones as much as mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.44,0:34:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么关机的人数应该不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}the list should be pretty small.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.38,0:34:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个人：汤姆·布鲁斯特 杰克·布林以及尼尔·丹尼而斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three names. Tom Brewster, Jack Boulin and Neal Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.15,0:34:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,查询罗斯住处所有与这三个人有关的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now check everything in Ross' apartment against those names.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.05,0:34:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check for common patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.79,0:34:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,找任何罗斯与人会面的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look for anything that indicates who Ross met.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.29,0:34:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放大他的单子 放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up his socials. Pull it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.66,0:34:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到文件了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See those documents?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.13,0:34:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.33,0:34:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.70,0:34:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那里 名字开头字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Right there. Initials.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.47,0:34:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放大 放到大屏幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull that up. Bring that up on main.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.21,0:34:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔·丹尼尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neal Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.77,0:34:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我们在马德里分站的头子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's station chief in Madrid, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.68,0:34:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.82,0:34:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知大使馆的安全官\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, call the RSO at the embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.75,0:34:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果丹尼尔斯在那里 收押他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have them take Daniels into custody, if he is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.19,0:34:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 派人到卡里诺特街的藏身处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, get grab teams to the Calle Norte safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.12,0:34:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们全副武装 告诉他们我们会帮忙封锁所有入口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send them in heavy. Tell them we'll assist with the entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.73,0:35:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,全副武装？丹尼尔斯不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavy? Daniels isn't really that much of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.89,0:35:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心的是伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried about Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不是线人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he is not the source,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.90,0:35:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他就是在追踪这个线人 与我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he is after the source, the same as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.20,0:35:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,二队什么时候到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ETA, Team Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.73,0:35:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 3分钟后抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three minutes to destination, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.03,0:36:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将拯救美国人民的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission will save American lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.47,0:36:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,献身这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really give yourself to this program.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.87,0:36:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.51,0:36:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.75,0:37:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 他们已经到达正门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, they're at the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.57,0:37:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 5秒钟 - 实时监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five seconds. - Put it up live.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.11,0:37:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.02,0:37:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,防盗铃被毁坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alarm's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.49,0:37:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gotta be Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.43,0:37:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保险箱空了 - 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The safe is empty. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.14,0:37:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似他匆忙离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he left in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.00,0:38:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,监控丹尼尔斯的护照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track Daniels' passports.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.41,0:38:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.84,0:38:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈蒙德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hammond.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.73,0:39:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！派后援部队！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it! Get a backup team in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.11,0:39:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我派上后卫队 立即派上另一队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a secure line in there. Get the second team over there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.32,0:39:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.76,0:39:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏林行动之后 我就被派到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was posted here after Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.30,0:39:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔斯在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.40,0:39:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.63,0:40:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.70,0:40:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.00,0:40:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是妮基·帕森\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Nicky Parsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.67,0:40:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是「踩石」计划的后勤\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was Treadstone. Logistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.71,0:40:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在柏林追捕伯恩时 她也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was with us when we hunted Bourne in Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.05,0:40:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮基 我需要进行身份核对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicky, I need to do an ID challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.35,0:40:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码是麻雀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code in, Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.15,0:40:29.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险回应：红宝石）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.29,0:40:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,回应是珠穆朗玛峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Response, Everest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.49,0:40:38.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正常回应：珠穆朗玛峰）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.47,0:40:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮基 我是诺亚·沃森 你到现场多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicky, this is Noah Vosen. How long have you been on-site?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.70,0:40:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just walked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在现场有我们两名同伴 你看到他们了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have two officers on-site. Are you in contact with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.51,0:40:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被放倒了 不省人事 不过还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're down. Unconscious but alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.02,0:41:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到尼尔·丹尼尔斯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of Neal Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.86,0:41:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.59,0:41:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮基 我是帕梅·兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicky, this is Pam Landy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.56,0:41:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有理由相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have reason to believe there's a connection between.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.60,0:41:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔·丹尼尔斯与杰森·伯恩有关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neal Daniels and Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.57,0:41:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩？你仍在找伯恩？我以为那个行动已经终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne? You're still looking for Bourne? I thought that case was closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 有人坚信他仍然是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, some people are convinced he's still a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.54,0:41:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为 不过我必须与他谈谈 才能知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disagree, but to find out I need to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.08,0:41:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 妮基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.41,0:41:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这是在干什么？- 我想给他传达一个信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you doing? - I'm trying to send him a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.58,0:41:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为伯恩不是威胁？他刚又放倒两个我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think Bourne is a threat? He just took out two more of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.02,0:41:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一妥善解决这件事的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way this has a happy ending, Noah,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.69,0:41:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是把他活捉\N{\fnArial\fs30}is if we bring him in alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.99,0:41:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在追踪丹尼尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is going after Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.99,0:41:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想复仇 帕梅 结束这一切的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants revenge, Pam, and the only realistic way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.79,0:41:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是解除威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}to end this is to eliminate the threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.89,0:41:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,后援什么时候能到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long until backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.13,0:41:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮基 请你留在原地 保护现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicky, I need you to stay put and secure the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.83,0:41:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,后援将在一小时之后到达 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backup will be arriving in approximately one hour. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.71,0:41:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.01,0:42:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有多长时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.35,0:42:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,3分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.02,0:42:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}My car's outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.22,0:42:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道丹尼尔斯在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where Daniels is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.90,0:42:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是卡里诺特街334号 刚听到抢响 有人喊叫 应该是美国人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.04,0:42:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.21,0:42:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,2分钟后抵达 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two minutes to destination, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.58,0:42:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕队A组和B组…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab Teams A and B…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.45,0:42:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔斯在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was Daniels headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.65,0:42:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早8点 他电汇了100 000美元 到丹吉尔的一个银行帐户\N{\fnArial\fs30}At 8:00 this morning, he wired $100, 000 to a bank account in Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.82,0:42:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这里300英里 如果加快速度 我们能赶得上早班轮船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, that's 300 miles away. If we hurry, we can make the morning ferry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.79,0:42:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车停在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you parked?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.86,0:42:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边 离北街20米\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the right, 20 meters, north side of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.77,0:42:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.94,0:42:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.31,0:43:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个目标从藏身处出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two subjects seen exiting safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.99,0:43:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.79,0:43:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.53,0:43:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.37,0:43:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标行踪丢失 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost visual contact with the subjects, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.10,0:43:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.67,0:43:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,下达指示 对伯恩格杀勿论 即刻生效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Issue a standing kill order on Jason Bourne, effective immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.04,0:43:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系西班牙方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send out a system one alert to all Spanish contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.38,0:43:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行全面封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want all air and ground border exits locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.94,0:44:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.31,0:44:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔斯手上到底有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Daniels got?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.71,0:44:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「黑荆棘」计划又是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Operation Blackbriar?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.92,0:44:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己告诉我 还是我打电话问克雷莫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to tell me, or should I call Kramer and ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.42,0:44:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天哪 帕梅 这可是在行动中\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Christ's sake, Pam, we're in the middle of an operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.59,0:44:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.13,0:44:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杰森·伯恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want Jason Bourne,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.06,0:44:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}level with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.61,0:44:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「黑荆棘」计划一开始是监视计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation Blackbriar started as an NEAT surveillance program.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.51,0:44:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么现在是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.78,0:44:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它是作为保护伞 掩护我们所有幕后行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now the umbrella program for all our black ops.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.18,0:44:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括侵入 押送 试验性审问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full envelope intrusion, rendition, experimental interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.02,0:44:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部由这个办公室发出指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}is all run out of this office.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.26,0:45:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是金字塔的顶端 帕梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the sharp end of the stick now, Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.46,0:45:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括杀害行动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lethal action?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.96,0:45:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在必要的时候 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we have to, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因如此 我们才特别 无需许可证\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what makes us special. No more red tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.47,0:45:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不用为了等华盛顿签署命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more getting the bad guys caught in our sights,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.64,0:45:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睁睁看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}then watching them escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.97,0:45:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏蛋从眼前逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we wait for someone in Washington to issue the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.64,0:45:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.81,0:45:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅 你大场面见过不少 你知道他们有多么危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen the raw intel, Pam. You know how real the danger is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.45,0:45:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要这样的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need these programs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.05,0:45:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔斯跟这个有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the connection to Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.09,0:45:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在南欧以及北非的所有行动都由他负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ran all of our operations in Southern Europe and North Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.86,0:45:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他掌握着所有资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he has everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.36,0:45:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字 日期 我们在海外的联系人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Names, dates, ghost sites, who's cooperating with us abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.13,0:45:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.07,0:45:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让这些落入伯恩手中 然后流入市场吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want that stuff in Bourne's hands, out on the market to the highest bidder?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.97,0:45:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.54,0:45:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩不是为了钱 他为了某个原因要找丹尼尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne's not after money. He's after Daniels for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.01,0:45:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 管他伯恩想找什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what does it matter what Bourne is after?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.68,0:45:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 只要找到丹尼尔斯 我们就能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we find Daniels, and, believe me, we'll find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.15,0:45:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.52,0:46:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩也会在我们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}we get Bourne, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.08,0:46:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.22,0:46:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要找丹尼尔斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you looking for Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.23,0:46:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这个是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.67,0:46:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是丹尼尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.14,0:46:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道另外一个是谁 他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who that is. Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.38,0:47:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一开始就在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.75,0:47:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得自己见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember meeting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.25,0:47:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.92,0:47:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔斯带我去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniels brought me to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.66,0:47:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是从那里开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where it all started for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.70,0:47:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我身上发生了一些事 我需要知道是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened to me and I need to know what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.70,0:47:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我永远无法摆脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll never be free of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.04,0:47:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔斯说 对你的训练是试验性质的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniels said the training was experimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.75,0:47:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,行为修正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behavior modification.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.75,0:47:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须先让特工瓦解 然后他们才能负责行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had to break down the agents before they became operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.15,0:47:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you were the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.59,0:47:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要帮我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.41,0:48:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你在一起 对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was difficult for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.08,0:48:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.23,0:48:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的什么也不记得了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.73,0:48:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.48,0:48:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:49.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（尼尔·丹尼尔斯护照追踪 锁定）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.75,0:48:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 威尔逊先生 你应该看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir? Mr. Wills? You're gonna want to look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.80,0:49:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在丹吉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.41,0:49:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚·沃森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah Vosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.25,0:49:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到丹尼尔斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have found Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.73,0:49:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们查到了他在丹吉尔的一个旅馆里 用了他的护照\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've just tracked Daniels' passport to a hotel in Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.63,0:49:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们借故拖延丹尼尔斯的银行转帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're holding up a bank transfer he made to keep him in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.60,0:49:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时从卡萨布兰卡派出了杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}while they bring an asset up from Casablanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.37,0:49:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.18,0:49:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.25,0:49:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅拉·兰蒂 她说有紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Pam Landy. She says it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.08,0:49:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她我没空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her I'm unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.58,0:49:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.58,0:50:29.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（摩洛哥 丹吉尔）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.31,0:50:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 杀手已经到达机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, asset has arrived at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.86,0:51:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我目标位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the subject's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.40,0:51:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标徒步 正进入莫拉博斯旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject is now on foot and entering Hotel Velasquez.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.74,0:51:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅馆距离银行2.2公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hotel is 2.2 kilometers from the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.64,0:51:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给出旅馆正面图 平面图 一间间找\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get an elevation and a floor plan, tic-tac-toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.91,0:51:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出房间位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locate the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.11,0:51:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉杀手房间位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the asset subject location.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.61,0:51:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及旅馆到银行的路线图\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the route between the subject's hotel and the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.27,0:51:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,房间位置确定了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have that room yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.37,0:51:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 117号房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. It's room 117.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.20,0:51:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握旅馆总线\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get a hold of the hotel trunk line.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.64,0:51:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,监控旅馆117号房间.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run all calls through here with an ISO on room 117.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.86,0:52:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的位置被防火墙阻挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}His location's being blocked by the firewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.19,0:52:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们已经找到丹尼尔斯了 也知道他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they found Daniels. They know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.69,0:52:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们派出杀手去解决他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll get one of the operatives to terminate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.60,0:52:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把杀手找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out who.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.97,0:52:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴仕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.94,0:52:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他你要见他 说你要给他一部新手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him you're gonna meet him and you have a new phone for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.94,0:52:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你阻止了戴仕 他们也会找别人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stop Desh, they'll just get someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.18,0:52:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是要阻止他 而是要跟踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not gonna stop him, we're gonna follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.25,0:52:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带领我们找到丹尼尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll take us right to Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.72,0:53:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 杀手背离了预定路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the asset is deviating off course.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.86,0:53:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it play.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.66,0:53:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手意外停止行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asset unscheduled stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.26,0:54:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 杀手正在向目标移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, asset is on the move en route to subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.19,0:54:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 有人未经授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we have an unauthorized breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.43,0:54:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,侵入我们的网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone with active system knowledge penetrated our protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.70,0:54:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在当地时间14：11向杀手发送指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instructions were sent to the asset at 1411 local time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.64,0:54:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,指令是有效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trace is confirmed and valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.40,0:54:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是通过妮基·帕森注册的计算机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came from a computer belonging to Nicky Parsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.28,0:54:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,背离发生在哪个地点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did the course deviation occur?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.21,0:54:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝尔基路南面 过了佛郎路\N{\fnArial\fs30}South to Rue de Belgique, stationary Place de France.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.98,0:54:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕森就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where Parsons is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.12,0:54:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决丹尼尔斯之后 让杀手解决妮可\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we're finished with Daniels, send the asset after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.42,0:54:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.49,0:55:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到帕森 找到伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find Parsons, we find Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.79,0:55:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚 你这是干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.19,0:55:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在不是时候 - 我需要知道 到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not now. - I wanna know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.86,0:55:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.30,0:55:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你依据什么发布这个指令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What basis are you continuing this operation on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.67,0:55:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的依据就是 妮基已经危及我们的隐蔽行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the basis that Nicky Parsons has compromised a covert operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.57,0:55:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把我们置于不利境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is up to her neck in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.84,0:55:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个行动是针对丹尼尔斯的 不是妮基\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about Daniels, not Nicky!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.57,0:55:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她背叛了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.84,0:55:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道情况 诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know the circumstances, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.51,0:55:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 她现在跟伯恩一条战线\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in league with Jason Bourne, for Christ's sakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.38,0:55:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无权杀死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not have the authority to kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.31,0:55:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我有权 你最好识点时务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, I do. And you had better get on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.48,0:55:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚 她是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, she's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.52,0:55:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一旦走出这一步 将要如何收场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start down this path, where does it end?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.12,0:55:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们获胜的时候就是收场的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ends when we've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.50,0:55:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决丹尼尔斯之后 让杀手干掉他俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we're finished with Daniels, send the asset after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.51,0:55:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.74,0:55:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 快点 - 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, come on. - Stand by…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.26,0:56:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,2分钟 长官 2分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two minutes, sir. Two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.77,0:56:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉银行解除电汇冻结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the bank to release the funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.82,0:56:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.12,0:56:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱已经到户
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.16,0:56:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.87,0:57:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经到位\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.03,0:57:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,200米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.27,0:57:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我应该多准备点跟踪摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on, I want to lay in some preliminary tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.31,0:57:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.42,1:09:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,发密信 就说我们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code it in. We need to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.56,1:09:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 杀手证实两个目标都已经被消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir? Asset confirms both targets are down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.01,1:09:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,活要见人 死要见尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be sure about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.61,1:09:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让拉巴特的站长确认死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask the station chief from Rabat to confirm the deaths.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.78,1:09:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密搜寻尸首\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do a sub-rosa collection of the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.58,1:09:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求这件事万无一失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to tie this thing off completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.65,1:09:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心监视兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep an eye on Landy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.93,1:10:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.03,1:10:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩和妮基·帕森都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne and Nicky Parsons are dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.27,1:10:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.67,1:10:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉巴特的站长正在核实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our station chief in Rabat is confirming.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.98,1:10:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不能让我暴露\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't afford to have this come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.41,1:10:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 你是受保护的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. You're protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.08,1:10:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定记住我们派兰蒂到你那里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember why we put Landy there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.82,1:10:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果「黑荆棘」计划泄露\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Blackbriar goes south,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.89,1:10:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就卷铺盖走人重新来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll roll it up, hang it around her neck and start over.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.29,1:11:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到他们的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see their faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀过的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone I ever killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.74,1:11:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是不知道他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know their names.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.72,1:12:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽过去常常…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie used to try to.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.26,1:12:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…帮助我回忆他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}help me remember the names.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.42,1:12:18.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（任务中止）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.32,1:12:20.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目标：尼瓦纳·瓦博斯； 国籍：尼日利亚）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.92,1:12:22.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（执行人：杰森·伯恩 | 「踩石计划」结果：失败）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.91,1:12:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想为我做过的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to apologize for…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.15,1:12:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过的一切道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.68,1:12:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我现在做的事情道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.12,1:12:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我的心依然沉重\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of it makes it any better.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.61,1:12:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会继续追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna come for you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.05,1:13:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须马上逃亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to run now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.20,1:13:31.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（「踩石」计划 杰森·伯恩）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.29,1:13:34.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（实验对象表现出反抗迹象）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.88,1:13:38.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿尔伯特·赫斯医生授权）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.71,1:13:45.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿尔伯特·赫斯医生 职位：首席医务官）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.72,1:13:52.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（对象在99年6月1日被送到纽约 东71街415号「踩石」特别治疗部门）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.14,1:13:57.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（特别研究部指导训练官 尼尔·丹尼尔斯记录）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.20,1:14:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.56,1:15:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.59,1:15:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔斯先生的东西都在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.60,1:15:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.89,1:15:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.02,1:15:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开看看
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.12,1:15:45.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中央情报局 纽约40街105号）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.29,1:15:52.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约）
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.13,1:16:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报站站长奥玛巴刚打电话过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station chief in Rabat just called.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.70,1:16:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found a body.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.90,1:16:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯恩？- 戴仕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bourne? - Desh.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.78,1:16:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅 你应该看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pam. You need to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.42,1:16:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫吉尔波特·皮安特的人 刚入境\N{\fnArial\fs30}A passport for Gilberto de Piento just cleared immigration.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.36,1:16:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是「踩石」计划中 杰森·伯恩的化名之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an early Treadstone identity registered to Jason Bourne,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.83,1:16:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来没有使用过这个化名 这个化名也从来没有浮现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he never used it, and it never went to the grid.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.00,1:16:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.17,1:16:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.27,1:16:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果知道 他们现在就不会呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if they knew, Vosen wouldn't be in his office right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.34,1:16:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是冒了极大风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hell of a risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.11,1:16:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许伯恩就是想让我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Bourne wants us to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.65,1:17:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像上次在那不勒斯一样 也许他在和我们联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like Naples. Maybe he's communicating.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.22,1:17:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他在联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's trying to communicate with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.32,1:17:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们应该回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we should communicate back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.66,1:17:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道伯恩在寻找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know what Bourne's looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.07,1:17:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔波特·皮安特 吉尔波特·皮安特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilberto de Piento. Gilberto de Piento.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.00,1:17:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伙伴在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your party is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.67,1:18:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅拉·兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela Landy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.23,1:18:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你还在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you're still looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.64,1:19:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.87,1:19:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.08,1:19:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.18,1:19:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好过来 我们发现了新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get in here. We got a situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.28,1:19:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.02,1:19:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…谢谢你提供的录音带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to thank you for the tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.02,1:19:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情已经全部解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all tied off. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.16,1:19:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我应该对你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.70,1:19:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是官方的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that official?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.57,1:19:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 非官方的 你知道原委的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Off the record. You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.50,1:19:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪结果？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tracing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.57,1:19:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要50秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty seconds to trace.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.14,1:19:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye. - Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.88,1:19:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维·韦伯 是你的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}David Webb. That's your real name.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.31,1:19:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生于71年4月15日的 密苏里州尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were born 4/15/71 in Nixa, Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.92,1:19:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不过来 我们好好谈谈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come in and we'll talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.82,1:19:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面绝对有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is very wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.36,1:19:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.73,1:20:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息一下 帕梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest, Pam.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.26,1:20:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很疲倦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.17,1:20:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在看着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's looking right at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.24,1:20:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}People, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.41,1:20:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是国家安全的紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a national security emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.38,1:20:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们即将受到严重威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an imminent threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.41,1:20:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.15,1:20:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现身 他就会找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I show myself, he'll find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.58,1:20:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森·伯恩还活着 就在纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason Bourne is alive and is at large in New York City,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.52,1:20:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信就在我们周围方圆1000码\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, we believe, within 1, 000 yards of this building.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.99,1:20:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求马上封闭周围12个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want an immediate 12-block lockdown of the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.72,1:20:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上通知兰利总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send a flash message to Langley.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.36,1:20:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动本地后备系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prep for local backup assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.83,1:20:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰蒂刚离开大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Landy just left the building!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.33,1:20:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,窃听她的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with her phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.68,1:20:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她正在用手机收短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's using her cell. There's an incoming text.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.89,1:20:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要短信内容 - 正在获取 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get it. - Working on it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.19,1:20:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有几个人跟踪兰蒂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many do we have on Landy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.36,1:21:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个 还有后援正在到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six men. More on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.59,1:21:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到了 先生 现在就显示到屏幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it, sir! Coming up on the screen now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.30,1:21:07.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（都铎城路和42街 10分钟后 单独见面）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.56,1:21:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟踪兰蒂的所有人 马上去都铎城路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody not on Landy goes directly to Tudor City.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.90,1:21:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备车辆 我们上车指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the vehicles. We're going mobile.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.17,1:21:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第二组 第二组 - 所有小组集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Team Two. Team Two. - All teams, call in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.64,1:21:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,178号\N{\fnArial\fs30}178th.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.65,1:22:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个死胡同 他为什么要这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way out of there. Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.45,1:22:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在困住自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trapping himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.82,1:22:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一个会面的好地点 太显眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bad place to meet. It's too exposed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.65,1:22:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他选这个地方一定有他的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't have chosen it if he didn't have a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.60,1:22:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标还在行进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject is en route.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.76,1:22:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶43 看到目标通知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roof 43, let me know when you have visual.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.77,1:22:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶43 随时待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roof 43, standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.27,1:22:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.38,1:22:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们现在行动 覆盖周围200米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, folks, here we go. Box 200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.81,1:22:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,已就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visual on leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.21,1:22:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面43号就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}43 ground in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.02,1:22:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一看到兰蒂 马上通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as you have eyes on Landy, I wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.30,1:22:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.53,1:22:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我也看到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. I see her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.45,1:23:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有伯恩的迹象吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.48,1:23:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.82,1:23:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有发现目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of target.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.90,1:23:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚·沃森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah Vosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.37,1:23:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.17,1:23:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在想你什么时候能给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering when you were going to make this call.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.94,1:23:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么得到这个号码的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get this number?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.58,1:23:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真以为我去都铎城路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't actually think I was coming to Tudor City, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.45,1:23:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.05,1:23:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果你想跟我谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it's me you want to talk to,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.99,1:23:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以安排一个会面地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps we can arrange a meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.52,1:23:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.16,1:23:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在我的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sitting in my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.59,1:23:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.63,1:23:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不信？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would you doubt that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.53,1:23:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你现在就在办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were in your office right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.00,1:23:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们就是在面对面谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd be having this conversation face to face.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.08,1:24:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚·沃森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah Vosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.51,1:24:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码10取消行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a code ten abort.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.32,1:24:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人回到车上 密码10取消行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everyone back in the vehicles. This is a code ten abort.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.85,1:24:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.25,1:24:21.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（绝密：黑荆棘计划）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.56,1:24:24.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（「踩石」计划升级到「黑荆棘」计划）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.84,1:24:28.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（被杀 机密：美国公民）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.11,1:24:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.24,1:24:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔森 马上检查我的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wills, check my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.28,1:24:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.35,1:24:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.99,1:24:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让保安到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need building security up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.73,1:24:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他拿走了全部档案 - 妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got everything. - God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.66,1:24:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁大楼周围4个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, set a four-block perimeter around the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.83,1:25:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要发现目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody give me a visual.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.20,1:25:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求整座大楼都被搜查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the entire building searched.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.67,1:25:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个房间 每个走廊 每个壁橱 每个通风道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every room, every hallway, every closet, every goddamn air duct.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.07,1:25:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？我要你们找到他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand? I want him found!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.71,1:25:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.04,1:25:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩进入大楼 打开了沃森的保险柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne just broke into CRI. He got into Vosen's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.52,1:25:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.78,1:25:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,东71街415号\N{\fnArial\fs30}415 East 71st Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.95,1:25:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,71街415号？天啊 帕梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four-fifteen-seventy-one? Jesus, Pam.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.55,1:25:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target in sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.99,1:25:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标向北转入第8大道\N{\fnArial\fs30}North on Eighth.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.63,1:26:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标进入港务局\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's headed east in the Port Authority.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.20,1:26:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,授权所有特工 可以格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}All agents have shoot-on-sight authorization.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.92,1:26:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.17,1:27:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 他开下房顶了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, he drove off the roof. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.67,1:27:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开下房顶了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drove off the roof!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.01,1:27:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他下车了 现在在跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on foot. He's running.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.79,1:27:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！不许动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police! Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.09,1:27:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.47,1:27:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫后援！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call for backup!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.63,1:28:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你看 伯恩的生日 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, sir, take a look at this! Bourne's birthday, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.43,1:28:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么问题？- 请看 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about it? - Check that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.83,1:28:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰蒂告诉伯恩他的生日是71年4月15号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, Landy told Bourne that his birthday was 4l15l71.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.93,1:28:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她告诉他的是一个密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. It's a code.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.54,1:28:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都停下手头的工作！听着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything stops. Everything stops! Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.24,1:28:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,4/15/71 新的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}4l15l71. New assignment, numbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.14,1:28:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这组数字是什么意思？快解码！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean? Give me encryption codes!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.08,1:28:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 转换成经纬度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, if you plug them in as variables of longitude and latitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.71,1:28:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是喀麦隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get Cameroon.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.55,1:28:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,41571是肯塔基州瓦尔尼的邮政编码\N{\fnArial\fs30}41571 is the zip code for Varney, Kentucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.42,1:28:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给的是什么数字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What date did she give him?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.69,1:28:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,4/15/71\N{\fnArial\fs30}4/15/71.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.39,1:28:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.69,1:28:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这组号码表示东71街415号\N{\fnArial\fs30}SRD is at 415 East 71st Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.43,1:28:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她告诉了他训练中心的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just gave him the training facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.23,1:28:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.43,1:29:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有小组跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring all the teams in behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.32,1:31:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！报警！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! Somebody call 911!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.09,1:31:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help him!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.46,1:31:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 特工没有杀掉伯恩 我们也跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The asset lost Bourne. We lost him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.17,1:31:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔伯特 我是沃森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Albert, it's Vosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.54,1:31:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩知道了一切 他正在去你那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne knows everything and he's on his way to you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.78,1:31:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming home, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.08,1:31:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有多长时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.98,1:32:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.28,1:32:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶快跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.72,1:32:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm gonna stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.75,1:32:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会来训练中心一侧 那是他以前待过的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll head for the training wing. That's what he knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.56,1:32:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会稳住他 直到你赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep him in play till you get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.58,1:33:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了我这些 他们会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll kill you for giving me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.68,1:33:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,4/15/71也不算密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}4l15l71 isn't much of a code.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.65,1:33:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜沃森已经赶过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess is Vosen is on his way already.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.36,1:33:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.26,1:33:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那不是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this isn't what I signed up for,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.46,1:33:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你做了这些 「黑荆棘」计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}what they did to you, Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.20,1:33:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't us.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.73,1:33:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你就做点什么吧 你需要的都在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do something about it. Everything you need is in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.71,1:33:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.48,1:33:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维 何不和我一起进去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}David. Why don't you come in with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.81,1:33:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起去会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be better if we do this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.38,1:33:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.68,1:33:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是我开始的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it started for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.35,1:33:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是结束的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.37,1:34:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Landy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.18,1:34:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼迪·艾伦 请拨分机200\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mandy Aaron, dial extension 200, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.08,1:34:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼迪·艾伦 拨分机200\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mandy Aaron, dial extension 200.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.28,1:34:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁这座大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, lock this building down.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.82,1:34:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围1个街区警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set a secure perimeter of one block.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.66,1:34:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是帕梅拉·兰蒂 我要发送机密文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. This is Pamela Landy. I have to send a classified document.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.20,1:34:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一个小组去追伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a team to SRD after Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.10,1:34:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人派到这个医院的所有公共区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}And put someone in every public area of this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.97,1:34:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯间 员工电梯 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Elevator shafts, service entrances, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.31,1:34:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！南边的电梯 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! South bay! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.45,1:34:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 这是紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, this is a priority one situation!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.38,1:34:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求你们的完全合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will give us your full cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.85,1:34:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看过去3分钟大厦的 全部监视录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me playback for the entire building for the last three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.08,1:34:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.90,1:35:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.00,1:35:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个！这是哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one, here! Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.17,1:35:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}First floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.37,1:35:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己去抓兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take Landy on my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.81,1:35:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好找个好律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better get yourself a good lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.39,1:36:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,剃刀边缘有个共和国\N{\fnArial\fs30}A republic lives on the knife's edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.57,1:36:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完成后 你就不再是戴维·韦伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we are finished with you, you will no longer be David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.01,1:36:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至记不得那个名字是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not even remember who he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.45,1:36:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么我们这么对待你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why we're treating you like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.19,1:36:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 杰森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.43,1:36:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你是遇到了一些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you've been having some problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.73,1:36:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.47,1:36:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不想谈的话就不会到这来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be here if I didn't want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.67,1:36:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过去三年一直在逃亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've spent three years running.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.71,1:36:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年来一直想知道自己是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years trying to find out who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.98,1:36:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是记不起来 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've still not got it all back, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.58,1:37:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,破碎的记忆难以拼凑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not filled in the pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.98,1:37:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.72,1:37:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有武器 杰森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm unarmed, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.02,1:37:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我？你为什么要选我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me? Why did you pick me?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.93,1:37:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的记不起来 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your really don't remember, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.93,1:37:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们选择你 而是你选择了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't pick you. You picked us.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.07,1:37:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是自愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.64,1:37:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.08,1:37:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们已经警告了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even after you were warned.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.69,1:37:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦伯上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.59,1:37:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.43,1:37:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.54,1:37:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛都没眨 杰森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't even blink, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.48,1:38:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这个递给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just handed me these.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.71,1:38:12.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（戴维·韦伯）
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.35,1:38:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的事情都对你解释了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has everything been explained to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.69,1:38:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.63,1:38:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你想报效国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to serve.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.63,1:38:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务会拯救美国公民的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your missions will save American lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.74,1:38:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.24,1:38:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我会拯救美国公民的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I'd be saving American lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.41,1:38:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.18,1:38:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在替你杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was killing for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.55,1:38:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,替他们杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For them.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.85,1:38:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全知道你选择留下 意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew exactly what it meant for you if you chose to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.79,1:38:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完成后 你就不再是戴维·韦伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we are finished with you, you will no longer be David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.10,1:38:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我成为谁 我就成为谁 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be whoever you need me to be, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.23,1:38:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能逃避你做过的事 杰森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't outrun what you did, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.50,1:39:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让自己成为了后来的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made yourself into who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.94,1:39:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终你必须面对现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually you're gonna have to face the fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.98,1:39:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在这里选择成为了杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}you chose right here to become Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.09,1:39:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很久没有睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't slept for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.93,1:39:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you made a decision?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.60,1:39:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样没法继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.04,1:39:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须现在决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.41,1:39:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.14,1:39:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经讨论过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.42,1:39:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he do?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.59,1:39:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.27,1:40:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.94,1:40:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是自愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.74,1:40:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你会做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you'd do anything it takes to.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.58,1:40:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来拯救美国公民的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}save American lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.38,1:40:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是在说谎 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a liar, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.55,1:40:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者太软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or too weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.92,1:40:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能胜任？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see this through?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.43,1:40:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.09,1:40:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘掉戴维·韦伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.60,1:40:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,献身这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really give yourself to this program.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.60,1:41:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.43,1:41:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维·韦伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.27,1:41:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起 你就是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, you'll be known as Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.18,1:41:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the program.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.53,1:41:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在记起来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember now?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.14,1:41:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.87,1:41:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记起来一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.34,1:41:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no longer Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.18,1:42:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你会杀我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you're gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.72,1:42:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.62,1:42:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不配挂在兰利墙上的星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't deserve the star they'd give you on the wall at Langley.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.17,1:42:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去屋顶了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's headed for the roof!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.39,1:43:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没有开枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you take the shot?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.60,1:43:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么要杀我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know why you're supposed to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.14,1:43:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.55,1:43:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们让你付出的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what they make you give.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.07,1:44:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 参议员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, senators.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.67,1:44:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我先发表一个声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I may, I'd like to begin by making a statement for the record.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.44,1:44:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,文件显示爱兹拉·克雷莫 授权6项非法的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The file indicates that Ezra Kramer authorized six illegal…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.15,1:44:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President convened.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.28,1:44:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,召开紧急内阁会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}an emergency cabinet meeting today.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.15,1:44:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨论越来越多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to discuss the growing scandal.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.62,1:44:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府涉嫌暗杀行动的丑闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}over an alleged government assassination program,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.46,1:44:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动代号「黑荆棘」\N{\fnArial\fs30}code-named Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.52,1:44:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,CIA局长爱兹拉·克雷莫因为授权此行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}CIA Director Ezra Kramer is under criminal investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.76,1:45:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到司法调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}for authorizing the program,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.70,1:45:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中几起涉及到杀害美国公民\N{\fnArial\fs30}which in several cases may have even targeted US citizens.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.74,1:45:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个CIA的高级官员已被逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two agency officials have already been arrested.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.51,1:45:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔伯特·赫斯医生 「黑荆棘」计划的策划者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Albert Hirsch, the alleged mastermind of Blackbriar program.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.34,1:45:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,CIA部门长官诺亚·沃森 计划实施的主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}and CIA Deputy Director Noah Vosen, the program's operational chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.32,1:45:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时戴维·韦伯 或者说杰森·伯恩的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, mystery surrounds the fate of David Webb,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.99,1:45:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然是个迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}also known as Jason Bourne, the source.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.89,1:45:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是揭露「黑荆棘」计划的关键人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}behind the exposure of the Blackbriar program.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.73,1:45:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,据报道韦伯被击中 从曼哈顿的10楼屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been reported that Webb was shot and fell from a Manhattan rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.23,1:45:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠入纽约东河\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the East River ten stories below.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.03,1:45:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是经过三天的搜寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, after a three-day search,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.07,1:45:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦伯的尸体仍然没有被找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Webb's body has yet to be found.
